# Keep local secrets out of the deployment bundle.
#
# `vercel deploy` uploads the working directory, and .env files are gitignored — so they
# are invisible to code review but still shipped. That is how the SyriaTalent FastAPI
# backend ended up on Vercel with SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY and the Cloudflare R2 keys
# baked into the deployment, connected to live production data, for 67 days.
#
# Environment variables belong in the Vercel project settings, not in the upload.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
